,"kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest is here — the extended demo is live!","summary":"The extended Witchkeeping demo has been updated with new language support and quality-of-life improvements. In this update: French, Polish and Traditional Chinese added. The demo now supports 12 languages. UI and HUD improvements. Improved the layout and readability of text, interaction hints and notifications. Updated the book tray to show the actual book spines and make the selected book easier to identify. Clarified request statuses and next steps in the lending ledger, along with the instruc","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T21:53:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692878","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5169710-1846651706685747","game_id":"steam-5169710","kind":"announcement","title":"The Witchkeeping demo is out now!","summary":"Hi everyone, You can now play the Witchkeeping demo for free on Steam! Madam Vesper is missing, and you've been appointed to look after the academy library. Sort through the books, solve the puzzles on their spines, and take your broom up to the higher shelves. There are wand boxes to put away, too. Then the owl arrives with the mail. Read the letters, find a story that could help with someone's trouble, and send them a book through Abracargo. Play the free demo: We'd love to hear what you think","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T22:42:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T23:53:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5169710":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T09:07:50Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-2